# Emeq Hub × DataForSEO: gerelateerde zoektermen (dataforseo_labs/google/related_keywords/live)
#
# Setup: zie consumer/domain-overview.http en README.md.
# Betaalde call: prijs per task plus per teruggegeven item, dus limit
# (1-1000, default 100) en depth (0-4) bepalen de kosten.

@baseUrl = http://hub.emeq.test:8092
@token = {{$dotenv EMEQ_HUB_PAT}}
@accountId = 47

### Gerelateerde zoektermen, defaults location_code 2528 (NL) en language_code nl
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/related-keywords?keyword=theorie+examen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Met depth en limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/related-keywords?keyword=theorie+examen&depth=2&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### depth boven 4 → 422 (validatie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/related-keywords?keyword=theorie+examen&depth=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}

### Zonder keyword → 422 (validatie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dataforseo/related-keywords
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
X-Account-Id: {{accountId}}
